# Imports of DIBENG.DLL, the DIB engine of Windows 95, 98 and Me that
# display minidrivers pass most of the GDI driver interface to (names and
# ordinals, the same in all three). Link a display driver with
# -Wl,@<sysroot>/lib/win16/dibeng.lnk; see include/dibeng.h.
